1: //! Symbol Game Minimal Host & Three-Layer Verification Protocol.
2: //!
3: //! Provides the trusted host interface for the Symbol Game solution engine:
4: //! 1. Three-layer sovereignty model:
5: //!    - Layer 1: L1 discrete projection governor (defect norm D(s), idempotent projection P_S, monotonic descent).
6: //!    - Layer 2: Simplicial boundary divergence (B^T z = 0 on vertices, cycle holonomy).
7: //!    - Layer 3: Phi_1 defect descent and exact rational weak duality certification (<z, r> == ||r||_{1,w}).
8: //! 2. Untrusted Proposer / Trusted Host Architecture:
9: //!    - Untrusted proposer submits exact rational algebraic data.
10: //!    - Trusted host re-derives all steps fail-closed with AuthorityEffect: None.
11: //!    - Immutable problem digest pinning (problem statements cannot be altered or erased).
12: //!    - Verified state transition logging with cryptographic parent linking.
13: //!
14: //! # Epistemic Firewall
15: //! AuthorityEffect: None.
16: //! Firewall: stated region only; mints no authority
